    SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=1790460774 fonttools varLib.instancer "MaterialSymbolsOutlined[FILL,GRAD,opsz,wght].ttf" FILL=0 GRAD=0 opsz=24 wght=400 -o MaterialSymbolsOutlined-Regular.ttf

The command removes the variation tables and prunes their name records.
